v7fuse 0.1.0 (2026-08-26)
=========================

First release.

- Mount a V7 (PDP-11) filesystem image read-write or read-only.
- Full middle-endian byte-order handling (16-bit LE; 32-bit high-word-first;
  3-byte block pointers; 4-byte indirect entries).
- Read/write/mkdir/rmdir/unlink/rename/chmod/chown/truncate/utimens/statfs.
- Free-list and inode-table integrity check with `-c`.
- Exclusive flock on the image for the whole mount, so a patched simulator
  pauses while the image is mounted.
